      {
        "id": "html",
        "type": "html",
        "css": ".ts-x-diagrams-html .lay { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; }\n.ts-x-diagrams-html .lay > .head { flex: 0 0 auto; }\n.ts-x-diagrams-html .rules { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 64px; }\n.ts-x-diagrams-html .rules .rows > div { padding: 10px 0; min-height: 79px; gap: 20px; }\n.ts-x-diagrams-html .ex { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 300px); justify-content: space-between; }\n.ts-x-diagrams-html .ex svg.dia { width: 300px; }",
        "html": "<div class=\"lay\">\n          <div class=\"head\">\n            <h2>Diagrams</h2>\n            <p>Every diagram is an inline SVG drawn in one grammar. The rows state the grammar, and the four examples below follow it.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"rules\">\n            <div class=\"rows\" style=\"--key:120px\">\n              <div><b>Strokes</b><span>Lines are 1px or 1.5px in ink, the body text tone, or the hairline, with square caps and no rounded joins.</span></div>\n              <div><b>Labels</b><span>Labels are 20px in the body text tone or 26px in ink, always horizontal and 12px clear of any line.</span></div>\n              <div><b>Markers</b><span>A value on a scale or a step on a flow is marked with an 11px filled square in ink.</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rows\" style=\"--key:120px\">\n              <div><b>Arrowheads</b><span>Arrowheads are never drawn. Direction comes from reading order, a marker, or a short tick.</span></div>\n              <div><b>Objects</b><span>Objects use one isometric projection at 30 degrees, with faces shaded 4, 9, and 15 percent.</span></div>\n              <div><b>Links</b><span>Links between objects use the doubled connector. Flows, axes, and scales use a single 1px line.</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ex\">\n            <svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 210\" aria-label=\"A three-step flow: a line with three square markers labeled Source, Translate, and Deploy, with the words strings and translations between them\">\n              <line class=\"ink\" x1=\"5.5\" y1=\"70.5\" x2=\"294.5\" y2=\"70.5\"></line>\n              <rect x=\"0\" y=\"65\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"144.5\" y=\"65\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"289\" y=\"65\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"75\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Strings</text>\n              <text x=\"222\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Translations</text>\n              <text x=\"0\" y=\"114\">Source</text>\n              <text x=\"150\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Translate</text>\n              <text x=\"300\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"end\">Deploy</text>\n              <text x=\"0\" y=\"204\">A three-step flow</text>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 210\" aria-label=\"A scale from Reserved to Playful with a center tick and an 11px square marker at 22 percent\">\n              <line class=\"hair\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"70.5\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"70.5\"></line>\n              <line class=\"mid\" x1=\"150.5\" y1=\"66.5\" x2=\"150.5\" y2=\"75.5\"></line>\n              <rect x=\"60.5\" y=\"65\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"></rect>\n              <text class=\"lab\" style=\"font-size:20px\" x=\"0\" y=\"114\">Reserved</text>\n              <text x=\"300\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"end\">Playful</text>\n              <text x=\"0\" y=\"204\">A scale with a marker</text>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 210\" aria-label=\"A stacked layer model: customer apps above the open-source libraries above the platform, the two GT layers on a plate\">\n              <rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"62.5\" width=\"299\" height=\"108\" fill=\"var(--plate)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"8.5\" width=\"299\" height=\"162\" fill=\"none\" class=\"hair\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>\n              <path d=\"M0.5 62.5 H299.5 M0.5 116.5 H299.5\" class=\"hair\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path>\n              <text x=\"16\" y=\"42\">Customer apps</text>\n              <text x=\"16\" y=\"96\">Open-source libraries</text>\n              <text x=\"16\" y=\"150\">Platform</text>\n              <text x=\"0\" y=\"204\">A stacked layer model</text>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 210\" aria-label=\"An isometric plate with three shaded faces and the mark seated in the top face\">\n              <polygon points=\"150,8 270,77.28 150,146.56 30,77.28\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" fill-opacity=\"0.04\"></polygon>\n              <polygon points=\"270,77.28 150,146.56 150,170.56 270,101.28\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" fill-opacity=\"0.15\"></polygon>\n              <polygon points=\"30,77.28 150,146.56 150,170.56 30,101.28\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" fill-opacity=\"0.09\"></polygon>\n              <polygon points=\"150,8 270,77.28 270,101.28 150,170.56 30,101.28 30,77.28\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mid\" stroke-width=\"1\"></polygon>\n              <path d=\"M30 77.28 L150 146.56 L270 77.28 M150 146.56 L150 170.56\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mid\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n              <g transform=\"translate(150 74) scale(1 0.5) rotate(45)\"><svg width=\"84\" height=\"54\" x=\"-42\" y=\"-27\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" fill-opacity=\"0.55\"><use href=\"#gt-mark\"></use></svg></g>\n              <text x=\"0\" y=\"204\">An isometric plate</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>",
        "note": "Escape: no block for <div class=\"rules\">. Source 25-diagrams.html; every scoped rule of the slide travels with the markup."
      }
    ]
  },
  "title": "Diagrams"
